  "notes": "{増減|ぞうげん} describes both increases and decreases—the overall variation or fluctuation in quantity.\n\nCOMPONENTS:\n- {増|ぞう}/{増|ふ}える: increase\n- {減|げん}/{減|へ}る: decrease\n\nCOMMON CONTEXTS:\n- {人口|じんこう}の{増減|ぞうげん}: population changes\n- {売上|うりあげ}の{増減|ぞうげん}: sales fluctuation\n- {体重|たいじゅう}の{増減|ぞうげん}: weight fluctuation\n- {在庫|ざいこ}の{増減|ぞうげん}: inventory changes\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {増加|ぞうか}: increase (only)\n- {減少|げんしょう}: decrease (only)\n- {変動|へんどう}: fluctuation, change\n- {上下|じょうげ}: ups and downs",
